"rövid életű, már befogadott munkatérpillanatképet rangsorol. Az olvasási "
"műveletek pontos profilhoz tartozó, sikeres, hatás nélküli bizonylatokat "
"adnak ki. Felületjegyzék "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/operator_surface/manifest.py`), "
"naptárlefedettség (`src/cadrumo/application/overview/coverage.py`), "
"felülvizsgálat (`src/cadrumo/application/review/read_operation.py`), "
"keresés (`src/cadrumo/application/search/installed_workbench.py`), "
"[elemzések](../articles/092-operator-action-and-command-surface-"
"contracts.md), [093](../articles/093-overview-calendar-filing-evidence-"
"and-readiness-views.md), [094](../articles/094-overview-explain-home-"
"pipeline-and-registered-read-projections.md), [096](../articles/096"
"-unified-review-queue-and-local-runtime-contracts.md), "
"[097](../articles/097-ephemeral-cross-workbench-search.md)."

#: ../../technical/topics/operations-profiles-and-workflows.md:14
msgid ""
